-- ============================================================
-- Alonecraft 4.61 -- Rogue / Subtlety, part 3 of 6
--   Waylay          -> unbalance debuff becomes avoidance + crit
--   Ghostly Strike  -> dodge buff extended to 20 sec
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md:
--   "Waylay: Your Ambush and Backstab hits have a 100% chance to unbalance
--    a target, reducing their chance to hit you by 2/4% and increasing
--    your chance to critically strike against them by 2/4%."
--   "Ghostly Strike: A strike that deals 125% weapon damage (180% if a
--    dagger is equipped) and increases your chance to dodge by 15% for
--    20 sec. Awards 1 combo point. 20s cooldown."
--
--
-- WAYLAY (51692, 51696) and its debuff (51693 -> 200502 / 200503)
--
--   Rank 1 procced at 50%; the spec wants 100% at both ranks, so only
--   51692's ProcChance changes.  The Ambush/Backstab restriction is NOT in
--   the DBC -- it comes from the core spell_proc row (SpellId -51692,
--   SpellFamilyName 8, SpellFamilyMask0 516 = Backstab bit 2 + Ambush
--   bit 9), which is deliberately left alone.
--
--   Waylay's only class mask sits on effect 2, a slot it does not use;
--   effect 1, the actual PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL, has no mask at all.  That
--   stale word is inert and is left as-is.
--
--   The shared debuff 51693 (-20% attack speed, -50% movement speed) is
--   replaced by two per-rank debuffs so the 2%/4% split can exist:
--
--     200502  Waylay rank 1   -2% hit chance, +2% crit taken
--     200503  Waylay rank 2   -4% hit chance, +4% crit taken
--
--   SPELL_AURA_MOD_HIT_CHANCE (54) on the enemy reduces that enemy's own
--   chance to hit -- the "reducing their chance to hit you" half.
--   SPELL_AURA_MOD_ATTACKER_MELEE_CRIT_CHANCE (187) on the enemy raises the
--   crit chance of everything attacking it, which is how the base game
--   expresses "your chance to critically strike against them".  Solo those
--   are the same thing; in a group it also helps the other attackers.
--
--   Both keep Waylay's original 8 s duration (index 31) and enemy target
--   (EffectImplicitTargetA 6).
--
--
-- GHOSTLY STRIKE (14278)
--
--   Already 125% weapon damage, +15% dodge, 1 combo point and a 20 s
--   cooldown -- only the buff duration was wrong (index 165 = 7 s).  It
--   moves to index 18 = 20 s.
--
--   The dagger bonus is deliberately NOT set here.  SpellEffects.cpp:3422
--   already adds +50% weapon damage to Ghostly Strike when a dagger is
--   equipped (its family flags fall inside the 0x6000000 test used there),
--   which lands at 187.5% rather than the 180% in the spec.  Overriding
--   that would mean carrying a script purely to shave 7.5%, so the core
--   behaviour stands and the tooltip states it plainly.
--
-- ============================================================
--
-- Note on the two new debuffs: 51693 is used only as a field template.
-- Three things it carries must NOT survive the copy --
--   Mechanic 11 (snare), which would make an avoidance debuff behave like
--   a movement impairment for immunity and dispel purposes;
--   its aura tooltip, which still described attack-speed and movement
--   penalties that no longer exist;
--   and a stale class mask on effect 2 (33554436).
-- All three are cleared explicitly below.
--
-- ============================================================


